WEBVTT

00:00:01.252 --> 00:00:05.464
Please keep what I'm about to sing

00:00:06.924 --> 00:00:08.926
<i>Just between us, okay?</i>

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:14.724
<i>The truth is, I want to keep my
desires hidden deep in my heart</i>

00:00:14.807 --> 00:00:16.851
<i>A secret, a secret</i>

00:00:33.117 --> 00:00:35.703
<i>I</i> want <i>to take shortcuts</i>

00:00:35.786 --> 00:00:39.582
<i>Never getting soaked by the rain</i>

00:00:39.665 --> 00:00:43.211
<i>Never getting knocked over by the wind</i>

00:00:43.294 --> 00:00:47.006
<i>Even if that's being devious, smile</i>

00:00:47.089 --> 00:00:51.469
<i>Even if I'm a coward, play with me</i>

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:55.056
<i>I don't</i> want <i>to feel sad</i>

00:00:55.139 --> 00:00:58.935
<i>Never getting soaked by tears</i>

00:00:59.018 --> 00:01:02.563
<i>Never feeling at my wit's end</i>

00:01:02.647 --> 00:01:06.025
<i>Just smile and think I'm insensitive</i>

00:01:06.108 --> 00:01:11.072
<i>Only tell me about fun things</i>

00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:19.372
<i>See, there are faces I</i> want <i>to
see and voices I</i> want <i>to hear</i>

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:24.252
<i>When I wake up I trumpet my joy:</i>

00:01:24.335 --> 00:01:30.299
Good morning!
Let's have another fine day!

00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:30.967
"Princess Jellyfish"

00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:36.430
<i>There's a secret in the closet.</i>

00:01:52.822 --> 00:01:56.200
Wow, Mama, this house is so big!

00:01:56.284 --> 00:01:57.702
That's right, Kuranosuke.

00:01:57.785 --> 00:02:01.831
If you study hard, Papa will
buy you whatever you want.

00:02:01.914 --> 00:02:05.001
Really? He'll buy me clothes?

00:02:05.084 --> 00:02:07.670
Of course he will. He's rich.

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:26.981
"Jubaku - Spellbound and Stone Broke"

00:02:32.194 --> 00:02:35.698
Wh-What's with those old glasses?

00:02:35.781 --> 00:02:37.700
They're lame... Even worse, they're huge!

00:02:37.783 --> 00:02:39.577
I lost mine.

00:02:41.287 --> 00:02:43.664
I'm going to the shop right now.

00:02:45.291 --> 00:02:46.667
<i>I</i> can <i>'t</i> ask.

00:02:48.294 --> 00:02:51.505
<i>There's just no way!</i>

00:02:51.589 --> 00:02:54.133
<i>"Hey Bro, are you still</i> a <i>virgin at 30</i>

00:02:54.216 --> 00:02:57.803
<i>because you got traumatized seeing
your dad and my mom getting it on</i>

00:02:57.887 --> 00:03:03.142
<i>in some walk-in-closet-type
deal in some backstage-type room</i>

00:03:03.225 --> 00:03:06.187
<i>at some theater-type place?"</i>

00:03:06.604 --> 00:03:09.774
<i>Even I</i> can't <i>ask that!</i>

00:03:12.818 --> 00:03:17.073
What? You're telling me the
Amamizu-kan deal isn't fixed yet?

00:03:17.156 --> 00:03:20.368
What's taking Acquisitions so long?!

00:03:20.451 --> 00:03:23.496
That place is huge; we
need to tear it down first.

00:03:23.579 --> 00:03:26.207
Well, they did get a verbal agreement...

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:29.001
But the owner's been abroad,

00:03:29.085 --> 00:03:31.754
so it's been difficult to
schedule a contract signing...

00:03:31.837 --> 00:03:35.049
For what it's worth, they think it
could come together next month.

00:03:35.132 --> 00:03:38.135
Next month? That's so late!

00:03:38.219 --> 00:03:43.015
Fine, I'm going. I've got business
in the neighborhood today anyway.

00:03:44.642 --> 00:03:47.228
I'm returning something
Koibuchi Junior left behind.

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:57.905
Hello, it's a pleasure to see you again.

00:03:57.988 --> 00:04:00.366
I'm from Global City Create.

00:04:02.118 --> 00:04:04.912
That "vwoosh"... They disappeared?

00:04:15.714 --> 00:04:17.341
Hiya! Clara here!

00:04:17.425 --> 00:04:19.885
The Banba Scope can
analyze the contents of any bag

00:04:19.969 --> 00:04:24.723
based on its logo and size.

00:04:24.807 --> 00:04:27.560
When a bag potentially contains
tasty things, in other words meat,

00:04:27.643 --> 00:04:32.565
high-end sweets, sea urchin,
squid, or other high-purine seafood,

00:04:32.648 --> 00:04:37.153
she intuitively knows that as well.

00:04:37.236 --> 00:04:40.781
Chieko, the vixen's got a box of snacks.

00:04:40.865 --> 00:04:43.451
Goodness... But I'm sure it's
only rice crackers or something.

00:04:43.534 --> 00:04:50.124
No... Judging from the design
and size, I'm thinking baked goods.

00:04:50.207 --> 00:04:51.584
It could be... macarons.

00:04:51.667 --> 00:04:53.461
M-Macarons?

00:04:58.174 --> 00:05:04.221
Hello, I'm the building manager.
How may I help you today?

00:05:04.305 --> 00:05:07.141
Ah, you must be the owner's daughter.

00:05:07.224 --> 00:05:09.768
I'm sorry to burst in on you like this.

00:05:09.852 --> 00:05:12.438
I thought I'd come pay my compliments
in person while I was in the area.

00:05:25.117 --> 00:05:26.452
The vixen attacks!

00:05:26.535 --> 00:05:29.955
Mayaya! Why are you
coming in through the window?!

00:05:30.039 --> 00:05:31.832
This is the second floor!

00:05:31.916 --> 00:05:33.584
Th-The vixen...!

00:05:33.667 --> 00:05:36.212
Huh? "Vixen"?

00:05:36.295 --> 00:05:38.881
She's here, yeah, she's here!

00:05:38.964 --> 00:05:41.759
She's come from the depths of Hell, yeah!

00:05:41.842 --> 00:05:44.845
The vixen's come to buy us out!

00:05:47.139 --> 00:05:49.517
She's come from the depths of Hell!

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:52.061
Yay! We got macarons!

00:05:53.229 --> 00:05:55.022
Macarons, you say?!

00:05:55.606 --> 00:05:57.608
What was she doing here?

00:05:57.691 --> 00:06:01.070
These are from the shop Yakkun
was raving about on Hanamaru Market!

00:06:03.364 --> 00:06:06.283
What the heck? There are glasses in here.

00:06:06.367 --> 00:06:08.160
Whose are they?

00:06:11.288 --> 00:06:17.253
So sorry! I accidentally
left something in that bag!

00:06:18.379 --> 00:06:22.925
Oh, my! What a fascinating room this is.

00:06:23.008 --> 00:06:24.385
Stay Out!

00:06:27.721 --> 00:06:31.934
Ah, here they are.
I'm sorry for being so careless!

00:06:32.017 --> 00:06:35.688
By the way, Minister Koibuchi's
manor is nearby, isn't it?

00:06:35.771 --> 00:06:38.857
Yeah, it's about 15 or 16 minutes on foot.

00:06:38.941 --> 00:06:40.067
What, are you a spy?

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:45.114
No, I'm just going to return a
lost item... Well, if you'll excuse me!

00:06:46.657 --> 00:06:49.243
Please do drop me a line
when your mother comes home,

00:06:49.326 --> 00:06:54.331
and <i>I'll</i> come explain the
contract to her right away.

00:06:54.415 --> 00:06:57.376
So, <i>I'll</i> be off, then.

00:07:00.963 --> 00:07:02.089
Who are you?

00:07:02.172 --> 00:07:05.050
Er, do you live here, Miss?

00:07:05.134 --> 00:07:06.594
Yeah, I do.

00:07:06.594 --> 00:07:07.428
"Lie"

00:07:07.428 --> 00:07:07.595
Nope, he's lying-

00:07:07.678 --> 00:07:10.472
Please excuse me. Here, my card.

00:07:16.228 --> 00:07:20.107
I should've known!
Where's all your battle gear?!

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:23.027
Well, they didn't warn us before they came.

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:25.654
Dammit... Hey, Iandsharks!

00:07:25.654 --> 00:07:30.701
"No Boys Allowed "

00:07:30.701 --> 00:07:31.076
none of the residents here
have the least intention of leaving!

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:35.581
So get out, and tell your boss,
"We can't make Amamizu-kan sell.

00:07:35.664 --> 00:07:38.626
It's not possible. It's Mission impossible."

00:07:39.126 --> 00:07:41.920
That's for the building owner to decide.

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:48.344
Owner... I see, the owner.

00:07:48.427 --> 00:07:52.473
Okay. Then we'll just have to
become the owners of this place!

00:07:52.556 --> 00:07:54.975
Pardon? I don't follow you...

00:07:55.059 --> 00:07:57.311
We'll buy this place!

00:07:57.394 --> 00:08:02.941
Buy it? Young lady, do you realize
what property values are like here?

00:08:03.025 --> 00:08:06.779
No. But we'll buy it no
matter how much it costs.

00:08:06.862 --> 00:08:10.240
A hundred million,
a billion, whatever. We'll buy it!

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:13.619
Mayaya, throw some salt!

00:08:13.702 --> 00:08:14.745
<i>Rfiger!</i>

00:08:14.828 --> 00:08:20.084
Woo, salt! Woo! Hakata Salt!

00:08:20.167 --> 00:08:22.878
Ha! Go home, go home, go home!

00:08:22.961 --> 00:08:25.589
Please come with an elderly boss next time!

00:08:25.673 --> 00:08:26.924
Hey, wait!

00:08:27.007 --> 00:08:29.385
Good! Defend that door!

00:08:30.636 --> 00:08:33.180
Okay, problem solved!

00:08:33.263 --> 00:08:35.808
Um... how so?

00:08:35.891 --> 00:08:42.231
Aw, no worries! I mean, my family's rich,
and I've got some dirt on my dad.

00:08:42.314 --> 00:08:45.526
Please stop saying things just
because you've gotten carried away.

00:08:45.609 --> 00:08:49.905
Anyway, Chieko, talk to your mom
about it when she gets back, okay?

00:08:49.988 --> 00:08:52.491
"Hey, Mama, sell me this building!"

00:08:52.574 --> 00:08:56.537
What?! Say that to my mother?!
Don't joke about such things!

00:08:56.620 --> 00:09:00.624
Um... Can I borrow you for a minute?

00:09:01.709 --> 00:09:06.338
It's not every day you
invite me to a park, Tsukimi!

00:09:06.422 --> 00:09:08.841
What brought this on?

00:09:08.924 --> 00:09:11.719
Um, Kuranosuke...

00:09:13.637 --> 00:09:17.433
That... That woman from
before... She's your 0-0...

00:09:17.516 --> 00:09:19.101
Ogre?

00:09:19.184 --> 00:09:27.609
No, your... older brother's
g-g-girlfriend, isn't she?

00:09:27.693 --> 00:09:31.071
Huh? You mean my brother?

00:09:31.155 --> 00:09:36.535
Yes. Um... she had glasses...

00:09:36.618 --> 00:09:38.704
Your brother's glasses.

00:09:38.787 --> 00:09:40.289
Glasses?

00:09:40.372 --> 00:09:44.877
Ah, come to think of it, he came
home without them yesterday,

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:48.922
and this morning he was wearing
these old huge, lame-o frames...

00:09:52.176 --> 00:09:55.137
So does this mean they're "doing it"?

00:09:58.724 --> 00:10:01.518
Ts-Tsukimi...?

00:10:01.602 --> 00:10:05.189
I saw them.

00:10:05.272 --> 00:10:08.692
I saw them together.

00:10:08.776 --> 00:10:10.778
Tsukimi...

00:10:10.861 --> 00:10:13.447
What are you crying for?

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:14.698
Why...

00:10:28.212 --> 00:10:32.800
You smell nice... Is it perfume?

00:10:41.141 --> 00:10:46.355
Listen... I am technically a guy, you know.

00:10:46.438 --> 00:10:49.024
Oh, right... I guess you are...

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:52.861
Lesbians!

00:10:52.945 --> 00:10:54.863
Can it, ya little punks!

00:10:54.947 --> 00:10:57.115
I'll go wash my face.

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:01.537
Sheesh“.

00:11:03.872 --> 00:11:04.581
It's commercial time!

00:11:04.623 --> 00:11:05.791
Clara!

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.043
It's the second half!

00:11:08.126 --> 00:11:09.086
Tequila!

00:11:13.632 --> 00:11:17.594
So... all of you have three-figure balances?!

00:11:17.678 --> 00:11:20.347
No, indeed! This month, I have two figures!

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:22.224
Why are you so broke?!

00:11:25.686 --> 00:11:28.272
Well, it's not like I ever expected you guys

00:11:28.355 --> 00:11:30.983
to have any savings in the first place...

00:11:31.066 --> 00:11:35.362
Money, money, money!
What's your game, you Zeni Geba?!

00:11:35.445 --> 00:11:38.407
Like I keep telling you,
we need to buy this place!

00:11:41.702 --> 00:11:43.078
What are you laughing for?

00:11:43.161 --> 00:11:47.124
Oh, please. You're stringing
out that gag too long.

00:11:47.207 --> 00:11:49.167
You'll never be a Katsura
comedy master that way.

00:11:49.251 --> 00:11:51.503
It's not a gag! I'm serious!

00:11:51.587 --> 00:11:54.506
If we put our minds to it, we can
make as much money as we need!

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:56.300
Just look at how many people we have.

00:11:56.383 --> 00:11:57.551
<i>--Mom, this person really is bonkers.</i>

00:11:57.551 --> 00:11:58.218
<i>--Don't</i> laugh!
<i>--Mom, this person really is bonkers.</i>

00:11:58.218 --> 00:12:00.178
<i>--Listen up, you!
--Mom, this person really is bonkers.</i>

00:12:00.304 --> 00:12:04.224
--Even Yuan Shao with all his family connections couldn't
buy it! --I don't know <i>how</i> he comes up with <i>these</i> things.

00:12:04.224 --> 00:12:05.225
--Even Yuan Shao with all his family connections
couldn't buy it! --He's like an alien.

00:12:05.225 --> 00:12:06.852
--Mayaya's right. Don't be ridiculous.
--He's like an alien.

00:12:06.852 --> 00:12:08.228
--Mayaya's right. Don't be ridiculous.
--Maybe because he's a rich boy?

00:12:08.228 --> 00:12:09.897
--Okay, enough.
--Maybe because he's a rich boy?

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:15.319
<i>But somewhere along the line,
we've gotten swept along by his tide.</i>

00:12:15.402 --> 00:12:19.197
<i>I've started feeling excited, somehow.</i>

00:12:21.408 --> 00:12:25.579
Wow, that girl was a real knockout, wasn't she?

00:12:29.207 --> 00:12:33.462
<i>As</i> if! She was just fooling you with makeup!

00:12:33.545 --> 00:12:36.924
If you washed her face off
she'd be nothing, you idiot!

00:12:37.007 --> 00:12:39.927
Those lashes were fake!
Those were Takako Style eyelashes!

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:41.553
You know, the Cinema Classic ones!

00:12:41.637 --> 00:12:43.931
There's like ten types, and
they're the thickest and longest!

00:12:44.014 --> 00:12:47.142
The ones that give you Hollywood eyes!

00:12:47.225 --> 00:12:50.312
B-But she had a great body, too...

00:12:50.395 --> 00:12:54.942
<i>As</i> if! She's like a beanpole, you friggin' moron!

00:12:55.025 --> 00:12:57.736
More like, nobody that
skinny has boobs like those!

00:12:57.819 --> 00:12:59.905
Fat deposits just do not work that way!

00:12:59.988 --> 00:13:02.532
They do not, not, not, not!

00:13:02.616 --> 00:13:04.952
Those are so implants! So fake! So silicone!

00:13:05.035 --> 00:13:07.579
She so gets hyaluronan injections!

00:13:07.663 --> 00:13:09.247
You're disturbing the neighborhood!

00:13:10.123 --> 00:13:12.209
"Them boobs is fake, bitches!"

00:13:12.209 --> 00:13:13.877
Stop it! We'll get arrested!

00:13:13.961 --> 00:13:18.548
Don't you worry! <i>I'll</i> wreck all the
rundown buildings in this neighborhood,

00:13:18.632 --> 00:13:21.927
and there'll be a gigantic hotel here!

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:23.762
Miss lnari, keep your voice down...

00:13:27.724 --> 00:13:30.310
Creepy! What is this room?

00:13:34.523 --> 00:13:36.316
Is it a Buddhist doll-disposal temple?

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:37.985
How dare you!

00:13:38.068 --> 00:13:42.197
I opened my private room just
for you, because you asked to see it!

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:44.157
Ugh, look at this!

00:13:44.241 --> 00:13:47.619
It's obviously one of those cursed
dolls that makes your hair grow!

00:13:47.703 --> 00:13:49.871
Okay, let's sell this one. It's scary.

00:13:49.955 --> 00:13:52.916
Sakurako!

00:13:54.835 --> 00:13:57.045
What did you just say?!

00:13:57.129 --> 00:13:58.839
T-Torpedo...

00:13:58.922 --> 00:14:00.090
Before the torpedo!

00:14:00.173 --> 00:14:05.178
I said let's sell these and put the
cash in our Amamizu-kan Purchase Fund.

00:14:05.262 --> 00:14:09.641
Sell them? Don't talk about it
like we'd just be selling some dolls!

00:14:09.725 --> 00:14:12.436
But... they are dolls!

00:14:12.519 --> 00:14:17.441
No, these girls are my
living, breathing daughters!

00:14:17.524 --> 00:14:19.109
Sakurako, Midoriko, all of them!

00:14:19.192 --> 00:14:21.820
Say, how much did Sakurako cost?

00:14:21.903 --> 00:14:23.280
200,000 yen.

00:14:27.117 --> 00:14:33.707
O-Chiyo! Matsuko! O-Take!
Bondo! Umeko! Kawako! Reiko!

00:14:38.962 --> 00:14:40.547
Do not ransack this place.

00:14:42.883 --> 00:14:48.847
Maybe you don't get it, but to
Chieko, they might as well be family.

00:14:50.891 --> 00:14:52.851
Like that "Extended
Family Special" thing on TV?

00:14:52.934 --> 00:14:53.727
Shut up!

00:14:53.769 --> 00:14:56.563
Just get out of this room, right now.

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:08.116
Okay... Here's your--

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:10.160
N-Naked man!

00:15:13.455 --> 00:15:16.166
Would you just get used to it already?

00:15:16.249 --> 00:15:17.834
P-Please put some clothes on!

00:15:17.918 --> 00:15:21.713
Aw, but my shoulders are all stiff!

00:15:23.006 --> 00:15:27.677
What's your problem? You were all
over me in the park not too long ago!

00:15:27.761 --> 00:15:33.308
"All over you"?! I was not!

00:15:33.391 --> 00:15:34.976
You've got a tea leaf on you.

00:15:47.823 --> 00:15:49.533
A decree!

00:15:49.616 --> 00:15:54.287
You! You there! ls there a
fax machine at your house?!

00:15:54.371 --> 00:15:57.332
If so, come to our aid this instant!

00:15:57.332 --> 00:15:57.791
"Fax machine broken.
Can't send my sketches. This is very bad."

00:16:00.335 --> 00:16:02.212
Welcome home.

00:16:02.295 --> 00:16:07.843
I'm sorry for making you
drive me on such a little errand.

00:16:07.926 --> 00:16:15.559
I don't mind that, but are you
sure you really needed new glasses?

00:16:15.642 --> 00:16:16.810
Look.

00:16:19.604 --> 00:16:21.982
I had business in the neighborhood.

00:16:24.442 --> 00:16:27.863
I'm glad I was able to return them.

00:16:27.946 --> 00:16:32.576
But perhaps I was a bit too late?
It looks like you've bought new ones.

00:16:32.659 --> 00:16:34.327
--Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:16:34.411 --> 00:16:36.246
--You look so distrusting.
--Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:16:36.246 --> 00:16:38.957
"Big Fat Lie" --It's all right. I can
keep a secret. --It's a big fat lie!

00:16:38.957 --> 00:16:40.834
--It's all right. I can keep a secret.
--It's a big fat lie!

00:16:40.917 --> 00:16:43.670
I won't tell anyone.

00:16:43.753 --> 00:16:46.506
May I ask you one question?

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:48.508
Go ahead.

00:16:48.592 --> 00:16:58.852
That night... Did we have...
s-s-s-sexual relations?

00:16:58.935 --> 00:17:03.732
I apologize, but I was highly
inebriated, and my memory is hazy...

00:17:03.815 --> 00:17:07.235
But I don't recall any such thing.

00:17:07.319 --> 00:17:12.365
What's more, I don't believe
I'm the kind of person who could, so...

00:17:12.449 --> 00:17:13.283
In other words...

00:17:13.366 --> 00:17:16.953
Here. Proof we made love.

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:39.142
<i>I... I...</i>

00:17:39.226 --> 00:17:42.437
<i>I almost, like, kissed a girl who's
practically a Shigeru Mizuki character</i>

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:45.482
<i>on some weird impulse!</i>

00:17:48.818 --> 00:17:53.240
Actually, Tsukimi! How can you
just sit there calmly drinking tea?!

00:17:53.323 --> 00:17:54.491
Isn't this messed up?!

00:17:54.574 --> 00:17:56.326
Huh? Wh-What is?

00:17:56.409 --> 00:17:57.327
So now you're saying

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:59.246
you don't even know what I did
because you had your eyes closed?!

00:17:59.329 --> 00:18:01.289
Dammit! You moron!

00:18:02.415 --> 00:18:05.669
No! You can't hold the manuscript
like that, or you'll crease it!

00:18:05.752 --> 00:18:09.756
That's worth 20,000 yen per page,
you know! You have to be careful with it.

00:18:09.839 --> 00:18:11.800
Huh? This stuff makes that much?

00:18:12.634 --> 00:18:16.012
Which means... 20,000 times...

00:18:17.847 --> 00:18:20.433
We humbly request your decree!

00:18:23.436 --> 00:18:25.897
Don't you think this system is messed up?

00:18:25.981 --> 00:18:28.483
She could just text message or
something if she doesn't want to come out.

00:18:28.566 --> 00:18:32.529
Shh! If she finds out
you're male, your life is over!

00:18:34.864 --> 00:18:38.952
"Who will suffer the most if
the building goes? Yes, it's me."

00:18:40.578 --> 00:18:44.791
"But I'm not selling any collections right now,
so I'm low on cash. Heh, heh, heh."

00:18:44.874 --> 00:18:48.962
"But if the serial comic I'm doing now is a hit,
I'll make the down payment myself."

00:18:51.214 --> 00:18:54.801
Okay! We have a down payment!
Now we just need...

00:18:58.013 --> 00:19:00.598
What are you talking about?

00:19:00.682 --> 00:19:04.644
I'm saying I'm going to buy an
apartment home, so lend me money.

00:19:04.728 --> 00:19:05.687
How much?

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:09.274
Dunno... I guess about 300 million?

00:19:09.357 --> 00:19:13.194
Well, I've got an early morning
tomorrow. I think I'll turn in.

00:19:13.278 --> 00:19:15.363
Hanamori told me, you know.

00:19:15.447 --> 00:19:18.408
He told me why Shu can't handle women.

00:19:18.491 --> 00:19:20.952
And you intend to blackmail me?

00:19:21.036 --> 00:19:21.953
Yeah.

00:19:22.037 --> 00:19:26.583
Whenever you went to see Mom's shows
you did the wild thing backstage, right?

00:19:26.666 --> 00:19:29.753
I can see why he'd be traumatized.

00:19:29.836 --> 00:19:36.259
Kuranosuke, I'll just say one thing. That day...

00:19:36.343 --> 00:19:38.720
...I only got to second base.

00:19:42.974 --> 00:19:48.104
I think second base is
enough to damage a child,

00:19:48.188 --> 00:19:50.315
but as blackmail material, it's a little weak.

00:19:50.398 --> 00:19:51.691
Yeah...

00:19:51.775 --> 00:19:53.735
Please don't touch that.

00:19:54.861 --> 00:19:58.323
You're looking especially
fashionable this morning.

00:19:58.406 --> 00:20:02.410
I've got an exam.
I figure cross-dressing is a bad idea.

00:20:02.494 --> 00:20:03.745
I see.

00:20:03.828 --> 00:20:07.916
Hey, this Benz you're always madly polishing...

00:20:07.999 --> 00:20:09.125
How much is it worth?

00:20:09.209 --> 00:20:12.879
An S-Class Mercedes-Benz
costs fifteen million yen.

00:20:12.962 --> 00:20:16.800
Fifteen million yen...?
How many Benzes do we have, again?

00:20:16.883 --> 00:20:18.385
Three.

00:20:18.468 --> 00:20:19.636
Right...

00:20:23.181 --> 00:20:24.766
Look, it's Kuranosuke!

00:20:25.892 --> 00:20:28.353
You never hang out with us anymore!

00:20:28.436 --> 00:20:32.107
Sorry, sorry. I'm really busy lately.

00:20:32.190 --> 00:20:35.610
What about today? Aren't you free?
Let's go out someplace!

00:20:35.693 --> 00:20:38.571
--Yeah!
--Hmm, today is...

00:20:39.322 --> 00:20:42.867
"Flea Market"

00:20:42.951 --> 00:20:45.245
"No Boys Allowed "

00:20:45.245 --> 00:20:45.412
Flea market?

00:20:45.495 --> 00:20:49.666
I've already reserved us a stall. It's in Harajuku.

00:20:51.459 --> 00:20:55.630
So, I'm going to have a
look through your storage.

00:20:55.713 --> 00:20:59.467
Stop! Mother will be angry!

00:20:59.551 --> 00:21:04.639
And you can sell off those expensive
clothes and purses you're always wearing first!

00:21:04.722 --> 00:21:07.100
Over my dead body.

00:21:20.905 --> 00:21:29.914
<i>I really want you to
realize that you're gorgeous</i>

00:21:29.998 --> 00:21:34.335
<i>Why haven't you realized it before this?</i>

00:21:34.419 --> 00:21:38.840
<i>It's like you've lost your heart</i>

00:21:38.923 --> 00:21:48.016
<i>I</i> want you to realize <i>it</i> right away,
right away, <i>I</i> want you to understand

00:21:48.099 --> 00:22:02.489
<i>I want you to realize it right</i> away,
<i>I want you to realize your beauty</i>

00:22:03.865 --> 00:22:08.328
<i>Because you're so very beautiful</i>

00:22:08.411 --> 00:22:12.415
<i>I want to convey that to you</i>

00:22:12.499 --> 00:22:22.091
<i>Your loveliness, forever and ever</i>

00:22:22.175 --> 00:22:30.517
<i>I'll be so happy if you'll
just realize your loveliness</i>

00:22:30.600 --> 00:22:35.313
<i>I</i> care about you, you know

00:22:35.396 --> 00:22:44.656
Please, realize your beauty
